{"title":"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/0/f6005cc96a5965c69e99d6c720eed3275f6e481a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(0,2)--(2,2)--(2,0)--cycle,dot); draw((2,2)--(0,0)--(0,1)--cycle,dot); draw((0,2)--(1,0),dot); MP(&quot;B&quot;,(0,0),SW);MP(&quot;A&quot;,(0,2),NW);MP(&quot;D&quot;,(2,2),NE);MP(&quot;C&quot;,(2,0),SE); MP(&quot;E&quot;,(0,1),W);MP(&quot;F&quot;,(1,0),S);MP(&quot;H&quot;,(2/3,2/3),E);MP(&quot;I&quot;,(2/5,6/5),N); dot((1,0));dot((0,1));dot((2/3,2/3));dot((2/5,6/5)); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"245\" />\n</p><p><br />\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/3/8a3b32228e9105bf0f3dffd78b0b7310083b693d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\times2$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> square, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is the midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840e2b592390eb6ec918fa6f3292716ce170de66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" />,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is the midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/3/e33fe7d65facd8868f58b6e94ddc7f153a5a3f9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" />,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/5/c65a0b904f8f63efdc2b5abfef3f4f05b2d3f990.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AF}$\" width=\"28\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/9/699784c989c3db382520e6f92819e062d239f504.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{DE}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> intersect at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/7/027f4a11d6090f9eac0ce2488df6384dad1263ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$I$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/7/4373e7b4be983c0315e82e1fda1df66ed34dd7fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BD}$\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/5/c65a0b904f8f63efdc2b5abfef3f4f05b2d3f990.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AF}$\" width=\"28\" height=\"15\" /> intersect at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/9/b1902d279ba37d60bdce4e0e987b7cd19d48974e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$H$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />, then the area of quadrilateral <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/2/f7288af87835526f26225bb1845f6d1f6a07e1a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BEIH$\" width=\"55\" height=\"12\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/d/49dffda6cf046b09221b8342777b6f8cf9c88744.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } \\frac{1}{3}\\quad \\text{(B) } \\frac{2}{5}\\quad \\text{(C) } \\frac{7}{15}\\quad \\text{(D) } \\frac{8}{15}\\quad \\text{(E) } \\frac{3}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"301\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1:_Coordinate_Geometry\">Solution 1: Coordinate Geometry</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1: Coordinate Geometry\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solution by you_r_gassy\n</p><p><br />\nFirst, we find out the coordinates of the vertices of quadrilateral <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/2/f7288af87835526f26225bb1845f6d1f6a07e1a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BEIH$\" width=\"55\" height=\"12\" />, then use the Shoelace Theorem to solve for the area. Denote <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/6/f9603ca3089464e548fc6f1366bc474e7efef8d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/b/91b4d91b2e7a94204137b6bfa24f62f46f4ab201.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E (0,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" />. Since I is the intersection between lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/5/6d5c9afa92ae3180f02754c177e530d9d0f8b4d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/d/c9daba06f5ec9c5069f24bbeab9c7151ab4f68c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, and since the equations of those lines are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/7/a8742cbebbfb7ca54516e5606d4227488f163e10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\dfrac{1}{2}x + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/a/b3afba9bab0b646898cf7677ad15f44cd527db3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -2x + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"98\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/a/9ca8a34714828db73d77088aac9e782556454be5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$I (\\dfrac{2}{5}, \\dfrac{6}{5})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"56\" height=\"37\" />. Using the same method, the equation of line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/f/89fff82bb65d0215e49c8c91cb7c553da52205e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/0/a40fee4603b4536f856dde720ee499468ace443f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/3/883daf974622afc2d065471751bf6a41144cc390.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$H (\\dfrac{2}{3}, \\dfrac{2}{3})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"63\" height=\"37\" />. Using the Shoelace Theorem, the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/2/f7288af87835526f26225bb1845f6d1f6a07e1a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BEIH$\" width=\"55\" height=\"12\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/e/b0e5a3dabe8c906d78f6d78c7b1bb5e29500259e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{1}{2}\\cdot\\dfrac{14}{15} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } \\dfrac{7}{15}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"141\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME\" title=\"1991 AHSME\">1991 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1991 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1991\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017182430\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.081 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 213/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2494/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5545/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.814      1 -total\n 61.78%    8.534      1 Template:AHSME_box\n 35.81%    4.947      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved 